    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Made for a scholar of Isengard's magic room, this band of tarnished silver was worked to sharpen a voice already sure of itself, so that words of power come quicker and land truer. The one who carries it feels an old, cold confidence settle into the bones, as if borrowed eloquence had always been there."
